From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaral Driver Lab <rickamaral94@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tu: A740 Aurora performance profile

Enable the community-tested Aurora tuning used by the A740 release:
- IR3 GCM enabled for A7XX compiler generation.
- pipeline and KGSL profiling suballocators increased to 512 KiB.

The upstream Mesa 26.3 branch already carries the Zelda-related
DONT_CARE/indirect-UBO workarounds in engine-specific driconf entries, so
this patch intentionally does not duplicate or globalize those options.

---
 src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c     | 2 +-
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c
--- a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c
+++ b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_nir.c
@@ -320 +320 @@ ir3_optimize_loop(struct ir3_compiler *compiler,
-      static int gcm = -1;
+      static int gcm = (compiler->gen == 7) ? 1 : 0;

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
@@ -1 +1 @@
-      &device->pipeline_suballoc, device, 128 * 1024,
+      &device->pipeline_suballoc, device, 512 * 1024,
@@ -1 +1 @@
-                              128 * 1024, TU_BO_ALLOC_INTERNAL_RESOURCE,
+                              512 * 1024, TU_BO_ALLOC_INTERNAL_RESOURCE,
